<title>UK: Scottish Hydro sets 150 mln stg bond.</title>
<headline>Scottish Hydro sets 150 mln stg bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-03-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Dresdner Kleinwort Benson and SBC Warburg.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SCOTTISH HYDRO-ELECTRIC PLC</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN STG   COUPON     **	  MATURITY    26.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  **	  PAY DATE    26.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  35 BP     REOFFER    **	  SPREAD	+57 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **TO BE PRICED</p>
<p> MOODY	AA3	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  A+	  DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  UK	  TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p>UNDERLYING GOVT BOND 7.5 PCT 2006 GILT</p>
<p> NOTES	UK UTILITY INVESTOR PUT</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
